[h1]迁移首都 | Move Capital[/h1]
[b]0.1.1 Alpha · 单人超凡帝国 · Windows x64 / WH3 9.0.4[/b]

在自有城镇面板点击“迁都”，确认后将派系首都移到该城镇。省会或小城均可作为普通目标；免费，不改变省会位置、建筑等级或城市归属，不额外添加收入加成。

这是从“征募与迁都”拆出的独立 Mod。[b]无需 memreader Plus，也无需招募刷新 Mod。[/b]

只能迁往玩家自有、未被围攻、不是废墟的常规城镇；当前首都不重复处理。仅支持单人超凡帝国，不支持联机、序章或特殊首都机制。其他组合 Mod 和种族的完整兼容性未做广泛验证。

操作前保留存档。禁用本 Mod 不会撤销已经保存的首都变化。结果未明时停止继续修改，不自动重试。

[h2]English[/h2]
Adds a free Move Capital button to owned settlement panels in single-player Immortal Empires. Province capitals and minor settlements can be regular targets. Ownership, building levels and province capital status stay unchanged. No additional income bonus.

Standalone: requires neither memreader Plus nor Recruitment Refresh. Targets must be owned, inhabited, not besieged, and different from the current capital. Windows x64, game 9.0.4. Multiplayer and special capital systems are unsupported. Keep a save before making changes; disabling the mod does not undo saved changes.

